stateDiagram-v2
    %% SP7 - Issue lifecycle (BR-23). Enforced by Issue.changeStatus(); menu built from Issue.allowedNextStatuses(user)
    state "In Progress" as InProgress

    [*] --> Open : createIssue(form)<br/>[required fields filled, room active]<br/>/ set targetDate, run onReported()
    Open --> Assigned : assign(assignee)<br/>[Admin only]
    Assigned --> InProgress : start work<br/>/ linked item → Under Repair
    InProgress --> Resolved : resolve(notes, newCondition)<br/>[notes not empty]<br/>/ run onResolved()
    Resolved --> InProgress : reopen
    Resolved --> Closed : close<br/>[Admin only]
    Open --> Rejected : reject(reason)<br/>[Admin only, reason given]
    Assigned --> Rejected : reject(reason)<br/>[Admin only, reason given]
    Open --> Duplicate : markDuplicate(original)<br/>[original exists, not itself]
    Assigned --> Duplicate : markDuplicate(original)<br/>[original exists, not itself]
    Closed --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    Duplicate --> [*]

    note right of Open
        Open, Assigned and In Progress = unresolved.
        isOverdue() is true when unresolved
        and today is past targetDate.
    end note
    note right of Closed
        Closed, Rejected and Duplicate are final:
        no status change and no new comments.
    end note
